<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-40 sm:pt-44 lg:pt-48">
  <div class="hero-orb one left-0 top-24 h-40 w-40 sm:h-64 sm:w-64"></div>
  <div class="hero-orb two right-0 top-40 h-40 w-40 sm:h-72 sm:w-72"></div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.03fr_.97fr] lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <div class="badge-pill mb-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-red-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M9.813 15.904 9 18l-.813-2.096a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-1.283-1.717L4.5 13.5l2.404-.687A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8.187 11.096L9 9l.813 2.096a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1.283 1.717L13.5 13.5l-2.404.687a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-1.283 1.717Z"/>
        </svg>
        Solução completa para sua cantina
      </div>
      <div class="section-kicker mb-4">SICAE</div>
      <h1 class="text-balance text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl dark:text-white">
        Menos preocupação, mais controle sobre a cantina da sua escola.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Você no controle de vendas, estoque e cardápio em tempo real. Os pais acompanham os gastos dos filhos, escolhem os produtos e pagam como preferirem — sem papel, sem fila, sem dor de cabeça.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <a href="/users/sign_up" class="btn-primary">
            <span>Começar grátis</span>
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <button type="button" data-modal-open="watch-demo" class="btn-secondary">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="m5.25 5.65 11.54 6.29a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.31l-11.54 6.29A.75.75 0 0 1 4.13 18.9V6.31a.75.75 0 0 1 1.12-.66Z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Ver demonstração</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div data-reveal class="surface-soft reveal delay-1 rounded-3xl p-5">
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">+10 escolas ativas</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">De rede pública a particular, o SICAE atende diferentes realidades.</div>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal class="surface-soft reveal delay-2 rounded-3xl p-5">
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Redução de desperdício</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Estoque controlado em tempo real significa menos perda e mais lucro.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div data-reveal class="dashboard-screen surface glow-border grid-backdrop reveal relative p-5 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">
        <div class="hero-orb one -right-10 top-10 h-36 w-36"></div>
        <div class="hero-orb two -left-10 bottom-8 h-32 w-32"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Painel ao vivo</div>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Dashboard da cantina</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Vendas, estoque e pedidos em tempo real.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="badge-pill text-xs font-semibold">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>Live
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="metric-card rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/90 p-5 text-white dark:bg-white/[0.04]">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">Vendas hoje</div>
            <div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold">R$ 3.240</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">+12% vs ontem</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/60 bg-white/80 p-5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/[0.04]">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Alunos atendidos</div>
            <div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">246</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">+9% esta semana</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/60 bg-white/80 p-5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/[0.04]">
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Movimento da semana</div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex h-36 items-end gap-3">
            <% [38, 72, 58, 96, 126, 84, 112].each_with_index do |h, i| %>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <div class="rounded-t-2xl bg-gradient-to-t from-orange-400 via-red-500 to-rose-500" style="height:<%= h %>px"></div>
                <div class="mt-3 text-center text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400"><%= %w[Seg Ter Qua Qui Sex Sáb Dom][i] %></div>
              </div>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
